===\n1230 | \n1231 |     >>> from sympy.combinatorics.fp_groups import FpGroup, CosetTable, define_schreier_generators, rewrite\n1232 |     >>> from sympy.combinatorics import free_group\n1233 |     >>> F, x, y = free_group(\"x, y\")\n1234 |     >>> f = FpGroup(F, [x**2, y**3, (x*y)**6])\n1235 |     >>> C = CosetTable(f, [])\n1236 |     >>> C.table = [[1, 1, 2, 3], [0, 0, 4, 5], [4, 4, 3, 0], [5, 5, 0, 2], [2, 2, 5, 1], [3, 3, 1, 4]]\n1237 |     >>> C.p = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n1238 |     >>> define_schreier_generators(C)\n1239 |     >>> rewrite(C, 0, (x*y)**6)\n1240 |     x_4*y_2*x_3*x_1*x_2*y_4*x_5\n1241 | \n1242 |     \"\"\"\n1243 |     v = C._schreier_free_group.identity\n1244 |     for i in range(len(w)):\n1245 |         x_i = w[i]\n1246 |         v = v*C.P[alpha][C.A_dict[x_i]]\n1247 |         alpha = C.table[alpha][C.A_dict[x_i]]\n1248 |     return v\n```\n\nFound function `sympy/codegen/rewriting.py:_matinv_transform`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n340 | def _matinv_transform(expr):\n341 |     left, right = expr.args\n342 |     inv_arg = left.arg\n343 |     return MatrixSolve(inv_arg, right)\n```\n\nFound function `sympy/solvers/solveset.py:solveset_real`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n2520 | def solveset_real(f, symbol):\n2521 |     return solveset(f, symbol, S.Reals)\n```\n\nFound function `sympy/solvers/solveset.py:solveset_complex`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n2524 | def solveset_complex(f, symbol):\n2525 |     return solveset(f, symbol, S.Complexes)\n```\n\nFound function `sympy/functions/elementary/complexes.py:Abs._eval_derivative`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n667 | def _eval_derivative(self, x):\n668 |         if self.args[0].is_extended_real or self.args[0].is_imaginary:\n669 |             return Derivative(self.args[0], x, evaluate=True) \\\n670 |                 * sign(conjugate(self.args[0]))\n671 |       